The buffering-quality conformance vectors, copied byte for byte.
The spec is docs/design/2026-10-17-buffering-quality.md in silo-server.
The file is identical at that commit, at silo-server main, and in the copy
silo-apple vendors (iosApp/Tests/Fixtures/BufferingQuality/vectors.json,
vendored from server commit aadc7fdf85878ff7d682d738120aa3abd45787b4).

bufferingQuality.test.ts replays every `cases` entry against a manual clock.
`connection_budget_cases` and `probe_cases` belong to the connection speed
test and are not replayed here.

Never edit this copy. A case that contradicts the spec is a spec bug: fix it
in silo-server, then re-vendor with

  git -C <silo-server> show <commit>:docs/design/schemas/buffering-quality/v1/vectors.json \
    > test/native/fixtures/buffering-quality/vectors.json

and update the commit and hash above.
